cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Folio PDF in your work, please cite it. Folio PDF is based on Sam PDF Studio by Sam Wasserman (wassermanproductions.com), which must also be credited per the project's NOTICE and Section 4(d) of the Apache License 2.0."
title: "Folio PDF"
abstract: "A free, open-source PDF editor for macOS: edit existing text and images in place (including Arabic), reflow paragraphs, annotate, sign, create forms, organize pages, protect, OCR, compare, convert and print."
type: software
